      "side": "The full ray from hand to target: a white-hot core in a pale glassy sheath with frost drifting off it. Crystal spikes jut out of the target and stay until they shatter.",
      "top": "A pale straight line to the target, then a star of ice crystals and a frost patch spreading across the ground; the frost stays after the spell.",
      "three_quarter": "Hero view. The ray recedes to the target, the crystal spikes read in depth around it and the frost patch reads as an ellipse growing on the ground."
